WEBVTT

00:07:00.291 --> 00:07:02.418
And that's something
you need to think about

00:07:02.418 --> 00:07:05.504
if say, you're in the business
of selling dog food

00:07:05.546 --> 00:07:07.465
or you just want to get a dog.

00:07:07.506 --> 00:07:11.260
And it's something very hard to see
unless you jump out of your fishbowl.

00:07:12.303 --> 00:07:15.181
Or for another example,
think about cell phones.

00:07:16.098 --> 00:07:18.225
I spent a lot of time with my teenagers

00:07:18.267 --> 00:07:22.188
worrying about why
they can't get off their cell phone.

00:07:23.022 --> 00:07:25.441
And the normal way
that people talk about that

00:07:25.483 --> 00:07:26.817
is to say, well,

00:07:26.859 --> 00:07:29.403
they're addicted to cell phones
because guess what,

00:07:29.445 --> 00:07:31.071
it's those algorithms,